## Key Learnings

- Configure both Forward and Reverse DNS before enabling production email services.
- Always ensure Forward DNS and PTR records resolve to the same hostname.
- Use IP-based Smart Host configuration when hostname resolution is unreliable.
- Configure domain masquerading to present the correct sender identity.
- Validate email deliverability with Gmail, Yahoo Mail, and Microsoft Outlook before production deployment.
- Proper DNS configuration significantly improves email reputation and Inbox delivery.
